a finger against me?

00:14:31.040 --> 00:14:34.840
No, I mean, what if it cost you 
your friends or something?

00:14:35.170 --> 00:14:38.020
Then they weren't really 
my friends to begin with.

00:14:38.250 --> 00:14:41.220
<i>Th-That's so cool!</i>

00:14:41.950 --> 00:14:46.830
<i>Compared to her, I'm such 
a small, petty person!</i>

00:14:46.830 --> 00:14:48.040
What's wrong?

00:14:48.040 --> 00:14:50.310
P-Please marry me!

00:14:50.980 --> 00:14:52.370
What the heck?

00:14:57.910 --> 00:15:00.000
We didn't earn much today.

00:15:00.490 --> 00:15:02.340
Well, it's only the first day.

00:15:02.660 --> 00:15:04.340
Yeah, I guess so.

00:15:04.340 --> 00:15:06.480
<i>I think they're ignoring 
me just a little bit...</i>

00:15:08.950 --> 00:15:10.560
Yotsuya-kun, behind you!

00:15:18.170 --> 00:15:20.930
A giant... bug corpse?

00:15:20.930 --> 00:15:23.100
Wait! I hear something!

00:15:24.940 --> 00:15:27.110
Ugh, a centipede?! Gross!

00:15:31.710 --> 00:15:32.610
A ball?

00:15:33.650 --> 00:15:34.620
A pillbug?!

00:15:36.950 --> 00:15:38.750
<b>Yotsuya Yuusuke</b>

00:15:36.950 --> 00:15:38.750
<b>Dead</b>

00:15:36.950 --> 00:15:38.750
<b>Reviving in</b>

00:15:38.740 --> 00:15:40.980
<i>Where'd something so strong come from?!</i>

00:15:40.980 --> 00:15:44.660
<i>Wait, my Chef skills can tell me 
an enemy's name and threat level.</i>

00:15:47.090 --> 00:15:48.250
<b>Dead</b>

00:15:47.090 --> 00:15:48.250
<b>Reviving in</b>

00:15:47.090 --> 00:15:48.250
<b>Shindou Iu</b>

00:15:48.500 --> 00:15:50.420
<i>Demon Bug Cadoomlet...</i>

00:15:50.420 --> 00:15:52.840
<i>The two of them have a combined 
threat level of D-.</i>

00:15:52.840 --> 00:15:55.540
<i>The pillbug is the male, 
and the centipede is the female?</i>

00:15:56.540 --> 00:15:58.310
Just leave this to me!

00:15:58.310 --> 00:16:01.240
<i>I don't know what's going on, 
but my time has come!</i>

00:16:01.240 --> 00:16:04.400
Yep, it sure has! 
Not that I even wanted it to!

00:16:04.730 --> 00:16:06.110
Majiha Pink!

00:16:06.110 --> 00:16:07.360
Majiha Purple!

00:16:07.360 --> 00:16:08.640
Together, we're Majiha!

00:16:09.460 --> 00:16:12.450
<i>In kindergarten, my dream for the future</i>

00:16:12.450 --> 00:16:14.040
<i>was to be a magic user.</i>

00:16:15.320 --> 00:16:17.250
With my crimson flame...

00:16:17.250 --> 00:16:19.680
<i>Kindergarten me, are you watching?</i>

00:16:19.680 --> 00:16:21.550
<i>Your dream came true!</i>

00:16:21.940 --> 00:16:24.480
With my crimson flame, I will burn all!

00:16:24.480 --> 00:16:26.380
Majiha Fire!

00:16:30.210 --> 00:16:34.760
Tokitate Yuka consumed all her mana to increase the temperature of 
the air within 10 centimeters of the end of her staff by 20 degrees Celsius.

00:16:32.490 --> 00:16:34.760
I-It's warm...

00:16:36.390 --> 00:16:37.430
<b>Tokitate Yuka</b>

00:16:36.390 --> 00:16:37.430
<b>Dead</b>

00:16:36.390 --> 00:16:37.430
<b>Reviving in</b>

00:16:37.690 --> 00:16:39.840
<i>I died?!</i>

00:16:39.840 --> 00:16:42.480
<i>I guess that's all you can 
do with rank 1 magic.</i>

00:16:42.890 --> 00:16:47.690
<i>That aside, why am I being treated like a 
malicious pervert for helping someone?</i>

00:16:49.770 --> 00:16:53.950
<i>Come to think of it, she did lecture 
me on how to be popular with girls.</i>

00:16:55.140 --> 00:16:57.800
<i>Wait, does that mean...</i>

00:16:58.540 --> 00:17:00.010
I was a loser?!

00:17:01.650 --> 00:17:03.190
<i>Ugh, talk about embarrassing!</i>

00:17:03.190 --> 00:17:05.780
<i>It took so much courage to walk her home!</i>

00:17:05.780 --> 00:17:07.750
<i>Why didn't that impress her?!</i>

00:17:08.050 --> 00:17:09.010
<i>Damn it!</i>

00:17:09.940 --> 00:17:11.920
<i>This can only mean one thing.</i>

00:17:12.330 --> 00:17:16.520
<i>It's possible that I'm someone 
who just isn't popular!</i>

00:17:17.470 --> 00:17:21.290
<i>Shindou-san said she liked one 
of the Yotsuyas, though...</i>

00:17:21.290 --> 00:17:23.470
<i>I'll just wait and see for now.</i>

00:17:23.470 --> 00:17:25.580
<i>For a month or two...</i>

00:17:26.030 --> 00:17:27.820
<i>Or maybe three!</i>

00:17:28.180 --> 00:17:33.240
<i>Man... I still don't understand 
it, but he </i>is<i> strong.</i>

00:17:33.730 --> 00:17:38.800
<i>Wait... He's actually more like 
Tatsuki-san than I realized.</i>

00:17:38.800 --> 00:17:40.660
<i>It's that gap moe!</i>

00:17:42.330 --> 00:17:44.000
Stay back!

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:45.670
Wind magic won't work on them!

00:17:45.670 --> 00:17:46.560
Got it!

00:17:48.780 --> 00:17:50.340
<i>Any venom? Spines?</i>

00:17:50.740 --> 00:17:53.800
<i>Nope, I don't see anything 
like that in its body!</i>

00:17:54.200 --> 00:17:55.000
<i>So...</i>

00:17:55.730 --> 00:17:57.780
This is the blind spot!

00:18:02.070 --> 00:18:04.230
<i>All right! I can cut off its legs!</i>

00:18:08.890 --> 00:18:10.610
I'm exhausted.

00:18:10.610 --> 00:18:12.100
How do we kill it?

00:18:12.100 --> 00:18:14.930
Well, there's one thing I'd like to try.

00:18:14.930 --> 00:18:16.030
Hakozaki-san...

00:18:16.030 --> 00:18:17.860
Y-Yes?

00:18:17.860 --> 00:18:22.170
I'm wondering if I can hold your 
long sword through your hand.

00:18:22.950 --> 00:18:24.770
What does he mean?

00:18:25.410 --> 00:18:26.520
Here.

00:18:30.070 --> 00:18:33.910
We can't hold any weapons 
other than our own.

00:18:34.210 --> 00:18:37.370
<i>I get it. If Kusue's the 
one holding the sword...</i>

00:18:38.150 --> 00:18:40.310
It worked. I can hold it.

00:18:40.310 --> 00:18:43.600
Let's swing it downward on 
my "three, two, one" count.

00:18:44.470 --> 00:18:47.980
Three... uh, a little more this way.

00:18:47.980 --> 00:18:48.880
Two...

00:18:48.880 --> 00:18:49.850
One!

