00:18:56.650 --> 00:18:57.880
What's wrong?

00:18:57.880 --> 00:19:00.250
Iu-chan hit me!

00:19:01.320 --> 00:19:02.820
What's wrong with that girl?

00:19:02.820 --> 00:19:04.740
Oh, you know. She's Shindou-san's daughter.

00:19:04.740 --> 00:19:06.320
Ah, them...

00:19:13.760 --> 00:19:15.150
What's wrong?

00:19:22.660 --> 00:19:24.570
You got into a fight?

00:19:26.710 --> 00:19:29.700
He kept saying things that made 
me mad, so I made him cry.

00:19:29.700 --> 00:19:32.080
You shouldn't do that. You're a girl.

00:19:32.080 --> 00:19:35.110
You'll lose all your friends 
if you're too violent.

00:19:35.110 --> 00:19:37.000
I don't need friends.

00:19:37.540 --> 00:19:40.490
Okay, do you want to be my friend, then?

00:19:40.490 --> 00:19:41.240
Huh?

00:19:41.980 --> 00:19:45.270
My name's Sayuri. What's yours?

00:19:46.340 --> 00:19:47.350
Iu.

00:19:48.780 --> 00:19:51.220
Sayuri-oneechan, today I...

00:19:51.880 --> 00:19:53.550
Sayuri-oneechan!

00:19:53.550 --> 00:19:55.310
Sayuri-oneechan!

00:19:55.310 --> 00:19:55.970
Sayu—

00:20:03.060 --> 00:20:05.720
It's a damn shame about Sayuri-chan.

00:20:05.720 --> 00:20:08.210
She was a great girl, other than her face.

00:20:08.210 --> 00:20:09.400
That's for sure.

00:20:09.400 --> 00:20:12.890
I guess just having an ugly face 
can make you end up like that.

00:20:12.890 --> 00:20:17.120
Makes me glad Iu is so gorgeous!

00:20:18.420 --> 00:20:21.260
Sure you're not just saying that 
as her dad? She's only five!

00:20:24.000 --> 00:20:26.670
I guess just having an ugly face 
can make you end up like that.

00:20:28.580 --> 00:20:30.690
<i>...you end up like that.</i>

00:20:34.750 --> 00:20:36.360
Did I wake you?

00:20:39.940 --> 00:20:42.710
I thought I was being pretty quiet.

00:20:44.950 --> 00:20:46.610
What are you doing?

00:20:46.610 --> 00:20:49.140
Weight training. I've been into it lately.

00:20:49.500 --> 00:20:54.020
<i>Huh? She doesn't seem 
like her usual self...</i>

00:20:55.020 --> 00:20:57.630
<i>Oh, right. She looked the 
same way that one time.</i>

00:20:58.520 --> 00:21:00.700
<i>At school, she's the undisputed queen.</i>

00:21:01.100 --> 00:21:03.940
<i>I could never even picture her crying.</i>

00:21:11.700 --> 00:21:13.650
Anyway, you were crying, weren't you?

00:21:14.330 --> 00:21:15.290
Huh?

00:21:15.290 --> 00:21:18.030
In that log from the previous quest.

00:21:19.160 --> 00:21:21.500
Why bring that up out of the blue?

00:21:21.500 --> 00:21:23.990
Huh? Uh, it just came to mind...

00:21:24.770 --> 00:21:28.170
You don't seem that observant, 
but I guess you are.

00:21:28.170 --> 00:21:30.350
Y-You think so?

00:21:31.830 --> 00:21:35.100
Yotsuya-kun, help me!

00:21:35.100 --> 00:21:40.070
<b>Help Me</b>

00:23:10.030 --> 00:23:13.610
Increase your live broadcast 
viewership tenfo.

00:23:10.030 --> 00:23:13.950
<b>Game Master</b>

00:23:13.960 --> 00:23:16.510
<i>Heya, Yukarion here!</i>

00:23:15.490 --> 00:23:19.490
Congrats on getting a time slot

00:23:16.510 --> 00:23:19.770
<i>Viewer count is at... twenty. 
Nowhere near enough.</i>

00:23:19.770 --> 00:23:21.000
<i>Want me to make an appearance?</i>

00:23:20.920 --> 00:23:22.540
Who's that?

00:23:20.920 --> 00:23:22.880
Whose voice is that???

00:23:21.000 --> 00:23:23.250
<i>Oh, no, no...</i>

00:23:21.170 --> 00:23:23.840
Who? Who? Who?

00:23:21.500 --> 00:23:22.670
Who!?

00:23:23.830 --> 00:23:26.110
There's no way I can increase it tenfold.

00:23:26.110 --> 00:23:28.490
Well, I offered to make an appearance.

00:23:28.490 --> 00:23:30.420
Iu-chan's a model, after all.

00:23:30.420 --> 00:23:33.890
<i>If I put a babe like Iu-san on my 
stream, I'll be compared to her.</i>

00:23:33.890 --> 00:23:35.620
I'll have to take off my—

00:23:35.620 --> 00:23:36.610
Take it easy!

00:23:37.050 --> 00:23:38.630
Hey, I've got it!
